## Governance
- `louis` remains the preserved v1.0 canonical baseline.
- Portfolio development takes place on `portfolio/en125-engineering-dossier`.
- New material is an additive, versioned engineering workstream; it does not silently rewrite the frozen baseline.
- Any future merge or release must preserve the distinction between canonical educational material, jurisdictional adaptations and the portfolio engineering dossier.
- `CABO_VERDE_ADAPTATION/` is not a Thailand compliance source.
